<mxCell id="e4" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=#C5221F&gt;G6 Risk: published default secrets&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A hash comparison of the chart 20.3.3 render shows these keys and the database password equal the public values.yaml defaults. Set the module&#x27;s concourse_* secret variables to replace them. Until then, anyone with the public chart has the same keys." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C5221F;" vertex="1" parent="e"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="36" width="590" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
